381
00:47:11.820 --> 00:47:20.220
they must resemble me and they must have the same manners as the, or manner is way of life.

382
00:47:20.220 --> 00:47:27.260
So make sure you write way of life there as the mother who delivered them. So they're a birth of

383
00:47:27.260 --> 00:47:32.540
the divine will. So the divine will is the mother and these children or these divine lives

384
00:47:32.540 --> 00:47:38.620
must resemble the divine will and they must resemble the mother that gave birth to them.

385
00:47:39.820 --> 00:47:49.100
So if you look melancholy, they will be put out of heaven and they will be told

386
00:47:49.100 --> 00:47:56.540
melancholy cannot enter our dwelling. Sadness is not for heaven. Sadness is for the earth

387
00:47:56.540 --> 00:48:06.060
or hell. So acts done in this mood are not going to get anywhere. They're not going to achieve

388
00:48:06.060 --> 00:48:15.180
their purpose. Melancholy cannot enter our dwelling. They will not be able to breach their way into

389
00:48:15.180 --> 00:48:20.860
creatures either because in seeing them melancholic, creatures will note that they are true

390
00:48:20.860 --> 00:48:28.220
legitimate children of my will. And besides, one who is melancholic does not have the grace

391
00:48:28.220 --> 00:48:34.860
to insinuate into others or to make their way into others, to conquer them and dominate them.

392
00:48:35.660 --> 00:48:44.380
But love, joy and peace has, has that power. So one who is melancholic is actually not capable

393
00:48:44.380 --> 00:48:52.460
of heroism and is not capable of giving himself for the good of all. Many times these children

394
00:48:52.460 --> 00:48:58.460
are aborted dying during labor. In other words, the acts don't actually complete

395
00:49:00.380 --> 00:49:06.780
and they don't even come out into the light of the divine will. So there's a good warning for us

396
00:49:06.780 --> 00:49:14.860
that we could be in a wrong spirit at the time we want to make an act and we think that the act

397
00:49:14.860 --> 00:49:22.140
is mechanical. So you just have to do it and it's done. It requires your whole soul to be involved

398
00:49:23.260 --> 00:49:34.300
and it requires you to be consciously aware, I should say, of being fused in the divine will

399
00:49:34.300 --> 00:49:41.180
and that you really want what the divine will wants to do with these acts. And then when you make

400
00:49:41.180 --> 00:49:48.460
them with the whole fervor of your being, God can use them in the way that he wants to use them

401
00:49:48.460 --> 00:49:51.940
and the Divine Will. So I'm going to stop there for the moment.
